Writing is the weakest score. At about 3,190 words the piece runs about a quarter over the roughly 2,500-word target for an open case, and "fits both readings" hedges recur in most sections.

I also listed two research tasks for the December 15 review. One is listening to the few podcast quotes still checked only against captions. The other is re-checking the three "as of today" facts above.
